swarm-state-diagram
    [*] --> CREATED

    CREATED --> ACTIVE_RUNNING: START

    ACTIVE_RUNNING --> ACTIVE_PAUSED: PAUSE
    ACTIVE_PAUSED --> ACTIVE_RUNNING: RESUME

    ACTIVE_PAUSED --> ACTIVE_USER_FEEDBACK: SUBMIT_FEEDBACK

    ACTIVE_USER_FEEDBACK --> ACTIVE_RUNNING: RESUME

    ACTIVE_RUNNING --> USER_VERIFICATION: FINAL_VERIFY
    ACTIVE_PAUSED --> USER_VERIFICATION: FINAL_VERIFY

    USER_VERIFICATION --> LEARNING: LEARN
    USER_VERIFICATION --> DELETED: DELETE
    USER_VERIFICATION --> ARCHIVED: IGNORE

    LEARNING --> ARCHIVED: ARCHIVE

    DELETED --> [*]
    ARCHIVED --> [*]
